<title>USA: General Cigar stake held by group.</title>
<headline>General Cigar stake held by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Zweig-DiMenna Partners said Thursday it holds a 5.6 percent stake in General Cigar Holdings Inc Class A common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it made a net purchase of 105,800 shares between June 17 and July 23 at prices ranging from $23.00 to $30.29 a share. The group said it holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
